{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45185","headline":"送珍上人还天竺兼寄广通上人秦山人 · 皎然","name":"送珍上人还天竺兼寄广通上人秦山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江寺名天竺，多居蹑远踪。\n春帆依柳浦，轻履上莲峰。\n禅子兼三隐，空书共一封。\n因君达山信，应向白云逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}